doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title BlockchainUNN 4.0 Hackathon Registration Confirmation
    link(rel="stylesheet", href="/css/styles.css")
  body
    .container
      p Hi #[strong #{firstName}],
      p
        | Welcome aboard! You’re all set for the #[strong BlockchainUNN Conference 4.0 Hackathon], and
        | we’re excited to see what you’ll create.
      p #[strong Here’s how to get started:]
      p #[strong Form Your Team:]
        | If you haven’t teamed up yet, now’s the time to connect with others.
        | You can form teams of 3-5 members. Don’t have a team? No worries—we’ll
        | help you find one through the hackathon's group below:
        span.flex-box
            p.mx-auto
                a.link(href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/CgwTbfez5TbI5fJx9EyJDa?mode=wwc") 👉 Join our Whatsapp Group
      p #[strong Get Ready for the Projects:]
        | During the hackathon, you’ll have the opportunity to work on impactful projects
        | across different blockchain areas.
      p
        | Prepare to collaborate, create, and compete for the top spot.
        | Our mentors will be available throughout the hackathon to guide you, and
        | you’ll have access to workshops, tools, and resources to help bring your project to life.
      p
        | Start brainstorming with your team now! We can’t wait to see your groundbreaking solutions.
      p
        | Best regards,
        br
        | The BlockchainUNN Team
      .footer
        p © 2025 BlockchainUNN. All Rights Reserved.
